        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/c/6de8d8/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2025-01-27T19:00:31.739Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Welcome aboard!</p>\n<p>I strongly suggest you read the KS page’s recent <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinel-comics-the-roleplaying-game/posts\">Updates (and comments thereon)</a> and <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinel-comics-the-roleplaying-game/comments\">Comments</a> sections.  For the most part they’re open to non-backers, and will give you a pretty clear idea of the current state of progress.  I believe <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/sentinel-comics-the-roleplaying-game/posts/4140662\">this update from last July</a> is the last time there was an estimated timeline for fulfillment, although that’s out of date since the Sentinel Choices zine game failed to ship in December.</p>",
